    "zh": "在 47 回合内用脉冲让三台对手机器人停机，芽芽要留在场上。第 7、13、20 回合结束时，三排风管的音窗依次换位。两台定点机器人守在风管间，簧片会追过来。起点的风琴拉栓可用 pick() 按下，打开两扇侧窗。",
    "en": "Tag out all 3 robots with pulses within 47 turns and keep Sprout running. The windows in the three ranks of pipes switch after turns 7, 13 and 20. Two bots hold their places among the pipes while Reed gives chase. Press the organ stop at the starting square with pick() to open two side windows."
